  (text "R10 (470): DAC output filter (datasheet: 470 Ohm + 2.2 nF)\nC28 (2.2nF): Ceramic capacitor\nC29 (10uF): Blocks DC between the 0 V DAC and the 4.3 V op-amp\nR11 (22k): Attenuator: 10k/(22k+10k) = 0.31, full scale 3 V peak -> 0.93 V peak\nR12 (10k): Bottom of attenuator, also biases the op-amp to VBIAS\nC30 (10uF): Blocks VBIAS from the output jack\nR13 (100k): Pull-down: keeps the jack at 0 V DC (no pop)\nR14 (1k): Protects the op-amp from shorts and long cables\nJ3 (OUT): Wire to the output jack: tip -> 1, sleeve -> 2\nC31 (100nF): Op-amp supply decoupling\nC32 (10uF): Ceramic capacitor"
    (at 12 69.7 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "9977e3a4-c7ba-5504-abd3-11248454a622"))
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/"
      (page "6"))))
